# Environment variables for Hedge Fund Portfolio Tracker

# OpenFIGI API Key (for CUSIP-to-ticker mapping)
# Sign up at: https://www.openfigi.com/api
# Free tier: 25 requests per hour
OPENFIGI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env (which is gitignored)
# 2. Replace 'your_api_key_here' with your actual API key
# 3. The app will automatically load it from the environment
